      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "content": "**Placeholder.** Trino query count, duration and failure rate are not emitted yet. The control plane only records its own REST calls to the lakehouse endpoints. Enable a Trino Prometheus or JMX exporter, add the `prometheus.io/scrape` annotations to the Trino pods, and scrape the `trino_query_*` metrics to fill a panel here.",
        "mode": "markdown"
