        "content": "**Placeholder.** Kafka consumer lag, Debezium connector status and Iceberg snapshot age are not emitted yet. Add a Kafka lag exporter for `kafka_consumergroup_lag`, a connector status exporter, and a maintenance metric from the `expire_snapshots` job to fill panels here.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
